sted anything we all applauded in an  effort to bulk up a real really accepted  the lead role in the short film called  blue season by filmmaker Georgia Higgins  created as part of the 2013 Syfy London  48-hour challenge Higgins told the  Guardian she was focused and giving and  open asking if there was anything she  should change or do we didn't have much  time for rehearsals and she worked  really well with that for the first part  of the film she was mostly hanging  upside down  really yeah moving up her hard work was  soon rewarded with guest parts in the  British medical drama casualty and the  comedy-drama Yungas by 2014 really had  impressed TV producers enough to start  being considered for bigger roles she  popped up as an enthusiastic shopper in  a season 2 episode of the popular drama  mr. Selfridge and she also snagged a  role in a two-part Silent Witness  special unknown while all of this  on-screen experience was a good start  for Ridley she still thought she was a  million miles away from being able to  audition for a Hollywood blockbuster  luckily for her the force awakens  director JJ Abrams wanted to cast  unknown actors just as George Lucas said  with the original Star Wars trailer J  Abrams admitted to Elle that the casting  process was scary because of the  inevitable scrutiny ahead for these new  actors he added so they needed to be  actors whom the audience could discover  as these characters not as actors that  seen elsewhere ideally it needed to be  people like Daisy somewhat experienced  but mostly new to the game nailed Ayer  Abrams took a liking to Ridley rights  away but the audition process was still  drawn-out and difficult Ridley told The  Telegraph in 2015 I was just one of the  lucky people who managed to get an  audition and he saw something in me I  thought that ruined the first few  auditions but he saw some potential I  guess and I was allowed to come back and  read again and then I finally got the  role release secured the part with her  fourth and final reading an emotionally  charged to audition that later found his  way onto the Internet  and she did it again I'm like what the  hell she was literally able to like you  know take a direction make it her own  make it better than I could have ever  imagined I I'm a crier I'm a big crier I  cried gathered a gym rat Ridley was  understandably thrilled when she got  confirmation that she'll be playing ray  but she knew that could change if she  wasn't physically prepared for the role  according to Elle to get into shape for  Star Wars she ate a diet that consisted  of lots of fish legumes and spirulina  shakes and trained for at least four  hours a day four days a week in addition  to intense indoor workouts that included  kickboxing and wall climbing with Lee's  trainer had a performance Prince with a  parachute attached to her back in the  parking lots of Pinewood Studios while  undeniably  tense that grueling workout schedule is  a small price to pay for a major part in  one of the most beloved film franchises  in Hollywood history thanks for watching  click the loop icon to subscribe to our  YouTube channel plus check out all this  cool stuff we know your love to  [Music]
 

